  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 503.05 Notice of Change of in Personnel Information. Within 5 working days the owner of a PWS shall notify the department whenever a change to the information provided pursuant to Env-Dw 503.03 occurs.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 503) #10465, eff 12-2-13; ss by #14006, eff 6-25-24",
